mpo and initiative. Since Black hasn't castled and the king is stuck in the center with an open e-file, this check will disrupt Black's coordination and potentially lead to further tactical opportunities. In chess, checking an uncastled king in the center is almost always a strong move when available.\n\n**Answer: R: f1-e1**"}
